# omp-sbx API keys
#
# Live file: ~/.config/omp-sbx/keys.conf  (or a per-project file passed to
#           omp-sbx via --keys)
# Format:   NAME=value - one per line (no spaces around '='). Blank lines
#           and #-comments are allowed. The value is either:
#             - a literal key: plaintext at rest, so this file must be
#               mode 0600 (omp-sbx tightens it if looser)
#             - an op:// reference, resolved via the 1Password CLI at launch
#
# MISTRAL_API_KEY=op://Private/Mistral API Key/credential
# OPENAI_API_KEY=op://Private/OpenAI/skey
# ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=literal-dev-key
